4</span>: The stockholders approved an amendment to the Company&#8217;s certificate of incorporation to effect a reverse split stock of
the Company&#8217;s outstanding common stock at a ratio of not less than 1-for-2 and not greater than 1-for-15, with the exact ratio
to be set within that range at the discretion of the Board and with such action to be effected at such time and date, if at all, as determined
by the Board prior to the one-year anniversary of the Annual Meeting without further approval or authorization of the Company&#8217;s
stockholders.</span></p>

